'''Vs Jack Hammer''' (VSジャック・ハンマー, ''VS Jakku・Hanmā'', '''VS Jack Hammer''') is a [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event|Hanma Baki: Son of Ogre]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 14.3 Update]]. The boss of this [[Gauntlet]] is [[Jack Hammer (Enemy)|Jack Hammer]].

==Overview==
===About===
Vs Jack Hammer contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Bite for Bite Lvs'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Bite for Bite Lv. can include [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Catamin]]s and Legend Dumbbells. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Vs Jack Hammer/Bite for Bite Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Vs Jack Hammer is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

